# Table styling by position and by column (reference/common/styles.md and reference/components/table.md).
# Page area of 260 × 160 from (20, 20). At size 10, a line measures 12 and each character 5.
#
# Columns: 100, 100 and 60, without a gap: x = 20, 120 and 220. Cell gives all of them Padding 2 4 (16 high).
#   Header cell: Border 0 0 1 0, so the header measures 17 (20..37).
#   Odd row cell: only the zebra background. Even row cell: Padding 4 4, and the row measures 20.
#   For column: 3 sets Padding 2 4 2 24 on the third column, and wins over Even row cell (position):
#     the content of that column measures 60 − 28 = 32, so "abc def" (35) breaks into two lines.
#   Footer cell: Border 1 0 0 0 (17); "Total" spans the first two columns.
# Rows: b1 (37..53, odd), b4 (53..73, even), b7 (73..101, odd: two lines in b9) and
#   b10 (101..121, even); the footer, at 121..138. The table measures 118.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: Cell
			Box:
				Padding: 2 4
		For element: Header cell
			Typography:
				Bold: true
			Box:
				Border: 0 0 1 0
		For element: Footer cell
			Typography:
				Bold: true
			Box:
				Border: 1 0 0 0
		For element: Odd row cell
			Box:
				Background: #F2EEE6
		For element: Even row cell
			Box:
				Padding: 4 4
		For column: 3
			Box:
				Padding: 2 4 2 24
	Section:
		Table:
			Id: t
			Column sizes: 100 100 60
			Column align: left left right
			Header rows:
				Row:
					Cell: Concepto
						Id: h1
					Cell: Detalle
					Cell: Total
						Id: h3
			Body:
				Row:
					Cell: Uno
						Id: b1
					Cell: dos
					Cell: 1.234
						Id: b3
				Row:
					Cell: Cuatro
						Id: b4
					Cell: cinco
					Cell: 56
						Id: b6
				Row:
					Cell: Siete
						Id: b7
					Cell: ocho
					Cell: abc def
						Id: b9
				Row:
					Cell: Diez
						Id: b10
					Cell: once
					Cell: 1.112
						Id: b12
			Footer rows:
				Row:
					Cell: Total
						Id: f1
						Span: 1 2
					Cell: 99
						Id: f3
